WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.186
The experiments span four datasets of increasing
difficulty.

00:00:04.266 --> 00:00:08.452
On Fashion MNIST,

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:12.719
small multilayer networks are used to cleanly
isolate and measure each source of bias.

00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:16.985
Then a recurrent convolutional architecture with
genuinely asymmetric feedback weights is trained on CIFAR-10,

00:00:17.065 --> 00:00:21.251
CIFAR-100, and finally ImageNet at thirty-two by
thirty-two,

00:00:21.331 --> 00:00:25.518
which is where the homeostatic loss really earns its keep.

00:00:25.598 --> 00:00:29.784
The authors also confirm in the appendix that the
same loss helps predictive coding networks,

00:00:29.864 --> 00:00:34.050
which have no reciprocal connections at all.
